t":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","review_id":"VDjGRUT2VXE-77RDD85wUg","date":"2018-05-14T23:02:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9460068941116333,"text_excerpt":"We had this place for breakfast on our second day in town. It was really good and fast and friendly service. There was a bit of a wait, but it makes sense because the cafe is very small, and we only had to wait about 20 minutes so it was fine. I got the crab and Brie crepes, which were very good. The crepes themselves were a little sweeter than I expected, but the flavors really worked. The grits were incredible."},{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","review_id":"JYuONETFebbdzjOtI7-e3Q","date":"2015-08-30T16:11:07","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.930572509765625,"text_excerpt":"This place is very quiet and quaint. It is well decorated with a classic French feel to it. The staff is very friendly and will tell you what's popular, but haven't personally tried the items on the menu. Boo! My water glass was never empty and they have a great selection of sweet and savory crêpes, as well as brunch items, salads and sides. They are reasonably priced, with the Shrimp and grits being the most expensive thing at $14. I got the bacon, brie, scallions and apricot crêpe. The food came out in a timely manner and was rather tasty. My wife got the mixed berries and crème anglaise crêpes and they were delicious as well. I would come back here."},{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","review_id":"Cfg40BzkqOAxH4duIYwNXg","date":"2017-10-05T17:51:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9282211661338806,"text_excerpt":"Quick, easy, delicious. I loved this place. There was plenty of open seating when we arrived on a Saturday at about 9.30 am, but it filled up quickly after that. The two servers were quick on the service-popping coffees and trays out left and right. My crepe was perfect: light and fruity with the creme anglais. (Another crepe I had the next day was waaaay to thick, so I appreciate this even more). The side of bacon was basic bacon, but that's good enough for me. The coffee was super good, even if I did add chocolate syrup to it. I wasn't sure about paying, but they ended up bringing us the check and we walked up and paid at the iPad. Walking in, they will direct you to a 2-top or 4-top ta..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","photo_id":"1onuNBJkDKANHKVSaHpMjw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1onuNBJkDKANHKVSaHpMjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9135128259658813},{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","photo_id":"4bYL70CwBkQZI_J24KUhHg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4bYL70CwBkQZI_J24KUhHg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9099192023277283},{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","photo_id":"JDbhPYSeO80cnuPXjEjRAg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JDbhPYSeO80cnuPXjEjRAg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8666613101959229},{"business_id":"W8YDBLJkvjVf0VUgXwE8VQ","photo_id":"fP8_H-jRa--aq-WvobmZww","label":"inside","image_